stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ANONYMOUS
  ANONYMOUS --> VERIFYING: asks about own account
  VERIFYING --> VERIFYING: failed attempt (1st or 2nd)
  VERIFYING --> VERIFIED: phone + last 4 match same loan
  VERIFYING --> HANDED_OVER: 3rd failure
  ANONYMOUS --> HANDED_OVER: handover trigger
  VERIFIED --> HANDED_OVER: handover trigger
  HANDED_OVER --> WITH_AGENT: agent claims
  WITH_AGENT --> VERIFIED: agent returns chat (customer was verified)
  WITH_AGENT --> ANONYMOUS: agent returns chat (not verified)
  ANONYMOUS --> CLOSED: 60 min total or 5 min idle
  VERIFYING --> CLOSED: 60 min total or 5 min idle
  VERIFIED --> CLOSED: 60 min total or 5 min idle
  CLOSED --> [*]
  note right of HANDED_OVER: bot silent, timers paused
  note right of WITH_AGENT: agent replies in same chat, bot silent, timers paused
  note left of VERIFIED: bound to one borrower_id for the rest of the session
